2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Autonomous\040Driving\072\040Technical\054\040Legal\040and\040Social\040Aspects)
/Author (Markus\040Maurer\054\040J\056\040Christian\040Gerdes\054\040Barbara\040Lenz\054\040Hermann\040Winner)
/Subject (This\040book\040takes\040a\040look\040at\040fully\040automated\054\040autonomous\040vehicles\040and\040discusses\040many\040open\040questions\072\040How\040can\040autonomous\040vehicles\040be\040integrated\040into\040the\040current\040transportation\040system\040with\040diverse\040users\040and\040human\040drivers\077\040Where\040do\040automated\040vehicles\040fall\040under\040current\040legal\040frameworks\077\040What\040risks\040are\040associated\040with\040automation\040and\040how\040will\040society\040respond\040to\040these\040risks\077\040How\040will\040the\040marketplace\040react\040to\040automated\040vehicles\040and\040what\040changes\040may\040be\040necessary\040for\040companies\077\040Experts\040from\040Germany\040and\040the\040United\040States\040define\040key\040societal\054\040engineering\054\040and\040mobility\040issues\040related\040to\040the\040automation\040of\040vehicles\056\040They\040discuss\040the\040decisions\040programmers\040of\040automated\040vehicles\040must\040make\040to\040enable\040vehicles\040to\040perceive\040their\040environment\054\040interact\040with\040other\040road\040users\054\040and\040choose\040actions\040that\040may\040have\040ethical\040consequences\056\040The\040authors\040further\040identify\040expectations\040and\040concerns\040that\040will\040form\040the\040basis\040for\040individual\040and\040societal\040acceptance\040of\040autonomous\040driving\056\040While\040the\040safety\040benefits\040of\040such\040vehicles\040are\040tremendous\054\040the\040authors\040demonstrate\040that\040these\040benefits\040will\040only\040be\040achieved\040if\040vehicles\040have\040an\040appropriate\040safety\040concept\040at\040the\040heart\040of\040their\040design\056\040Realizing\040the\040potential\040of\040automated\040vehicles\040to\040reorganize\040traffic\040and\040transform\040mobility\040of\040people\040and\040goods\040requires\040similar\040care\040in\040the\040design\040of\040vehicles\040and\040networks\056\040By\040covering\040all\040ofthese\040topics\054\040the\040book\040aims\040to\040provide\040a\040current\054\040comprehensive\054\040and\040scientifically\040sound\040treatment\040of\040the\040emerging\040field\040of\040autonomous\040driving\042\056)
/Keywords (24\040Jun\0402016)
>>
